        <briefdescription>
<para>Appends one element object: its path, its position, its type, its name, and its extra members. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The element must hold a name. The position is the line and the column of its last name token. appendMembers runs before the closing brace, so each caller adds its own members to the same object. Hover and document symbols need this, because each adds members that the others do not.</para>
